config AXS15231B_TOUCH
	bool "AXS15231B integrated touch controller driver"
	depends on AXS15231B
	depends on I2C
	select INPUT_TOUCH
	help
	  Enable driver for the capacitive touch controller integrated in the
	  AXS15231B LCD chip (e.g. the 3.5" 320x480 panel on the Guition
	  JC3248W535 / cobantab1a module). The controller shares the display
	  die but has its own I2C host interface (address 0x3B); no interrupt
	  or reset line is required, the driver polls it.
